three 3~
3a. How well do you know your character?
    How much can you depend on your skills and spells to work when you
    want or need them to?

3b. How well do you know yourself as a mudder?  Are you average, not so
    great, or  really skilled?  Are you daring, or timid?  Are you
    confident or doubtful?

3c. What type of time do you have to do this?  Can you spend an extra 2
    hours if you need to(such as for a messy corpse recovery), or do
    you HAVE to leave in 20 minutes, no ifs ands or buts?  Do you have
    5 hours a week, or 40 hours a week to mud?  Is your link stable? 
    What's the likelyhood that you'll be interrupted in RL?  
~
